git-svn-id: https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/oozie/trunk@1515666 13f79535-47bb-0310-9956-ffa450edef68

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the MapReduce action incorrectly retrieving counters from the launcher job instead of the actual MapReduce job. This was due to the use of `action.getExternalId()` to fetch the job ID, which did not point to the correct job, leading to the failure in obtaining the expected counters.

